# W5-A: ALL12 (Moscow) opening with real orders only (no cheats).
# The 3 elite ParaSEALS drop at the corner of the BadGuy2 Tesla Reactor's fence
# ring, the ring's only opening (two fence pieces touch only at a corner: the
# W5-A wall diagonal gap). Ordered onto the reactor they walk in and plant C4;
# its 15 Tesla Coils go dark, 'Generators Destroyed' starts the Chrono
# reinforcements: the Chrono MCV (deployed here), 8 IFVs, then 8 Grizzlies.
# Before W5-A the mission was lost at ~17 s / the reactor was unreachable.
set render_every 3000
set on_quit continue
set campaign all12s.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
until 600 carried(0) == 0 and units(0,GHOST) >= 3
assert outcome == RUNNING
click unit 0:GHOST:0
click unit 0:GHOST:1 shift
click unit 0:GHOST:2 shift
assert selected == 3
click building 2:NAPOWR
until 600 buildings(2,NAPOWR) == 0
assert units(0,GHOST) == 3
until 1200 units(0,AMCV) >= 1
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
until 600 units(0,FV) >= 8
assert outcome == RUNNING
until 4500 units(0,MTNK) >= 8
assert units(0,GHOST) >= 2
assert buildings(0,GACNST) >= 1
assert outcome == RUNNING
shot chrono
end
